   "cause": "+560 B in the slot line and nothing else. PLUS the stage-20 repair of finding S19-F1 (`group_sumcheck_bits`): the two bilinear slots sum over the log2(kv_heads) key-value GROUP bits instead of fixing them on both private factors, which adds those main rounds and one degree for the public eq(r_g, .). The memo predates the repair and prices the old schedule. This term is +336 B at both rungs (lkv = 1) and +560 B at 125M (lkv = 2), and it is zero at the toy (lkv = 0), which is why the frozen toy profile does not move.",
